# React components

- Use functional components and server components by default.
- Add `"use client"` only when hooks or browser APIs are required.
- Keep components presentational; move data access to Server Actions or page loaders.
- Colocate feature components under `src/components/features/`.
- Shared primitives live in `src/components/ui/`.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — data fetch in client component
"use client";
useEffect(() => { fetch("/api/profile")... }, []);

// ✅ GOOD — fetch in server component or Server Action
export default async function Page() {
  const profile = await getCurrentUserProfile();
  return <ProfileCard profile={profile} />;
}
```
